  "details": "In a SDK update I would like to see some changes to the layout on how things are displayed.\n\nContent Manager:\n- Tabbed sections for world and avatars.\n- Search & filters\n- World URL generation\n\nVideo with a example of how it could be: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=lGUq5C8D2jc\n\n\nBuild Control Panel:\n- Launch into desktop or vr without having to unplugging the VR or use of third party.\nhttps://i.imgur.com/j6rMmrk.png\n\n\n*Also, I do not endorse modifying the SDK at any point. This is just show what it can look like.*",
